 video—wherever you are, whenever you need it. All our clinicians are highly experienced and fully licensed.\n\nBENEFITS:\n- Fast access to doctors with drop-in availability\n- Always available appointments\n- Top-level security with BankID/MitID authentication\n- Encrypted video consultations\n- Doctors available 365 days a year from 8 AM–10 PM (10 AM–10 PM on weekends and holidays)\n- Other healthcare professionals available weekdays minimum 8 AM–8 PM\n- 95% of users rate us 5 out of 5 stars\n- Over 500,000 consultations completed\n\nOPENING HOURS:\nAppointments can be booked 24/7 in the Eyr app.\nDrop-in wait time is typically 5–15 minutes.\nNo waiting time for scheduled appointments.\n\nPRICING:\n- Doctor consultation: DKK 350 / NOK 395 / SEK 395\n- Psychologist consultation: DKK 1,200 / NOK 1,450 / SEK 1,450\n- Mental self-help – initial assessment: DKK 490 / NOK 490\n- Mental self-help – follow-up: DKK 890 / NOK 990\n- Physiotherapist consultation: DKK 329 / NOK 545\n- Patient service: DKK 4,000\n\nPSYCHOLOGY & PHYSIOTHERAPY TREATMENT:\nDigital treatment programs combine video sessions with structured self-help modules.\n\nINSURANCE:\nIf you have health, home, or travel insurance, your consultation may be covered.\nCoverage details are available in the app.\n\nWHAT WE TREAT:\nWe assist with illness, injuries, and mental health concerns.\nFor severe or chronic conditions, we refer to appropriate in-person care.\nIn emergencies, call local emergency services.\n\nSAFE AND SECURE:\nOur service meets all healthcare security and privacy standards.\nSecure login via BankID/MitID.\n\nOUR VISION:\nTo make healthcare more accessible—every day.","minimumOsVersion":"16.4","averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.84854,"trackContentRating":"17+","sellerUrl":"https://eyr.md","languageCodesISO2A":["DA","EN","NB","SV"],"fileSizeBytes":"73895936","formattedPrice":"Free","userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":11376,"sellerName":"Eyr Medical AS","price":0.0,"genreIds":["6020","6013"],